{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this shadowed world, secrets lie buried deep, and dangers wait in silence. Hordes rise against me, yet I cleave through them with elemental fury. I master the primal forces, bending chaos to my will. In this moment of convergence, I discover my true self, a being forged in both fury and beauty. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is my dominion now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/1_nofilter_set.gif?t=1742475536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/01_Become_VOIN_EN.gif?t=1742475536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I am the essence of ancient storms, summoned by a force beyond mortal comprehension. Born of the will of a faceless mage, I exist for one purpose alone: to become the weapon that reshapes a world ravaged by plague. My creators remain hidden, shrouded in mystery, yet I feel their command burn within me. This world is broken, and I am its reckoning. For I am VOIN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/2_nofilter_set.gif?t=1742475536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/SLAY-THEM-ALL.gif?t=1742475536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every strike I make is a hymn to destruction. My movements are a sacred dance within the heart of chaos.\u00a0My blade sings as I sever through their ranks, executing perfect strikes, untouchable. I walk this path with purpose\u2014will I remain unscathed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/3_nofilter_set.gif?t=1742475536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/FEEL-THE-FREEDOM.gif?t=1742475536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The wind bends to my will. I leap across the ruins of once-grand castles <strong>with ease and</strong> soar above rivers raging far below. My fury rains down on them from the sky, leaving nothing but silence in my wake. I was never meant to crawl\u2014I was born to be unbound and untethered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/4_nofilter_set.gif?t=1742475536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/04_Arrive._Raise_Hell._Repeat_EN.gif?t=1742475536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I dive into the abyss, seeking the power that lies within. I claim weapons forged in the depths of darkness, gear that pulls me closer to my truest self. Yet this is only the beginning. I return to the Master\u2019s Citadel, cleansing what I\u2019ve gathered, sharpening the edge of my soul. And once more, I plunge back into the fray, unbroken, stronger than ever. This cycle defines me\u2014the unyielding, ever-reborn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/5_nofilter_set.gif?t=1742475536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/FACE-SPINE-CHILLING-BOSSES.gif?t=1742475536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They stand before me\u2014titans of flesh and fury, living monuments to annihilation. Their eyes gleam with malice, their tactics ruthless. They believe they will break me. But I face them without fear. For I am no mere mortal standing in their shadow\u2014I am the force destined to shatter their dominion. I walk among gods and monsters, and I do not tremble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/6_nofilter_set.gif?t=1742475536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2464530?t=1742475536","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742475536","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742475536","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742475536","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game is centered around hack and slash mechanics. While fighing monsters you can cut off head, hands or legs from those monsters. After death corpse disappears in matter of seconds."},"detailed_description":"<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/Thunderborn_merged_logo.png?t=1742475536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The skies flash with fury, and the world trembles. A storm is rising, and only the <strong><i>Thunderborn</i></strong> can stand against the abominations and spectral horrors summoned by <i>HER</i> will. Will you answer the call?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the first of several major updates, bringing long-planned additions to the game, and many of those that were shaped by your feedback.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">New MASSIVE Dungeon Awaits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Descend into the abyss beneath the Cathedral of Veiled Lament. Explore breathtaking yet deadly vistas and face the guardian of Hadracon\u2019s Scroll\u2014<strong><i>Nomme, The Summoner of Tears</i></strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">New Enemies to Slay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dead rise at <i>HER</i> call.\u00a0<i>HER</i> will has stirred ancient titans of fire and ash.\u00a0<i>HER</i> twisted craft have led to monstrous mutations, creatures grown beyond reason.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">New HIGH-LEVEL Arena to Test Your Might</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep in the dungeon lies the <strong>Circle of the Damned</strong>. Aid the ancient king <i>Sedogor</i> to purge the arena of filth and claim a weapon so powerful it tears through reality itself. Nothing shall stand between you and the cleansing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>And Much More:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New weapons and items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rich chests with greater rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An optional boss with a unique reward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay improvements and fixes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The path to cleansing has only just begun. More challenges, expanded world activities, and even greater battles lie ahead. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>A chilling horror is coming</strong></i>.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this shadowed world, secrets lie buried deep, and dangers wait in silence. Hordes rise against me, yet I cleave through them with elemental fury. I master the primal forces, bending chaos to my will. In this moment of convergence, I discover my true self, a being forged in both fury and beauty. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is my dominion now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/1_nofilter_set.gif?t=1742475536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/01_Become_VOIN_EN.gif?t=1742475536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I am the essence of ancient storms, summoned by a force beyond mortal comprehension. Born of the will of a faceless mage, I exist for one purpose alone: to become the weapon that reshapes a world ravaged by plague. My creators remain hidden, shrouded in mystery, yet I feel their command burn within me. This world is broken, and I am its reckoning. For I am VOIN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/2_nofilter_set.gif?t=1742475536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/SLAY-THEM-ALL.gif?t=1742475536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every strike I make is a hymn to destruction. My movements are a sacred dance within the heart of chaos.\u00a0My blade sings as I sever through their ranks, executing perfect strikes, untouchable. I walk this path with purpose\u2014will I remain unscathed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/3_nofilter_set.gif?t=1742475536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/FEEL-THE-FREEDOM.gif?t=1742475536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The wind bends to my will. I leap across the ruins of once-grand castles <strong>with ease and</strong> soar above rivers raging far below. My fury rains down on them from the sky, leaving nothing but silence in my wake. I was never meant to crawl\u2014I was born to be unbound and untethered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/4_nofilter_set.gif?t=1742475536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/04_Arrive._Raise_Hell._Repeat_EN.gif?t=1742475536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I dive into the abyss, seeking the power that lies within. I claim weapons forged in the depths of darkness, gear that pulls me closer to my truest self. Yet this is only the beginning. I return to the Master\u2019s Citadel, cleansing what I\u2019ve gathered, sharpening the edge of my soul. And once more, I plunge back into the fray, unbroken, stronger than ever. This cycle defines me\u2014the unyielding, ever-reborn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/5_nofilter_set.gif?t=1742475536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/FACE-SPINE-CHILLING-BOSSES.gif?t=1742475536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They stand before me\u2014titans of flesh and fury, living monuments to annihilation. Their eyes gleam with malice, their tactics ruthless. They believe they will break me. But I face them without fear. For I am no mere mortal standing in their shadow\u2014I am the force destined to shatter their dominion. I walk among gods and monsters, and I do not tremble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/extras/6_nofilter_set.gif?t=1742475536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","developers":["Nikita Sozidar"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464530/header.jpg?t=1742475536","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257114512,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114512/movie480.mp4?t=1741969313","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114512/movie_max.mp4?t=1741969313"},"name":"Thunderborne_trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257114512/822246102b4bb328ab339044a6dd28cafa14b028/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741969313","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114512/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741969313","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114512/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741969313"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257080630,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257080630/movie480.mp4?t=1733853052","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257080630/movie_max.mp4?t=1733853052"},"name":"EA Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257080630/7a6e30fb5bbdc33953e89319c863a8aaecd5643d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1733853052","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257080630/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1733853052","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257080630/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1733853052"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257060361,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257060361/movie480.mp4?t=1728035979","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257060361/movie_max.mp4?t=1728035979"},"name":"VOIN Convergence trailer","thumbnail":"https://share